{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36277","headline":"项洙处士画水墨钓台 · 方干","name":"项洙处士画水墨钓台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画石画松无两般，犹嫌瀑布画声难。\n虽云智惠生灵府，要且功夫在笔端。\n泼处便连阴洞黑，添来先向朽枝乾。\n我家曾寄双台下，往往开图尽日看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}